        <div class="story-hlight__stories">
          <div class="story-hlight__stories-inner">
            <div class="story-hlight__lg-main-intro story-hlight__item">
              <div class="story-hlight__item-inner">
                                  <h2 class="story-hlight__heading paragraph__header colored-heading">
                    <p><strong>Make</strong> Your <em>Mark</em></p>
                  </h2>
                
                                  <div class="story-hlight__intro paragraph__intro">
                    <p>Learn from industry-experienced faculty and gain hands-on experience in labs, workforce programs, and career-focused courses.</p>
                  </div>
                              </div>
            </div>

                          <div class="story-hlight__story story-hlight__item" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="story-hlight__story-inner">
                  <div class="story-hlight__media">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__cover">
                        <img alt="Jorgo Gushi" title="" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_highlights/public/uploads/images/2025-07/homepage_jorgo_story.jpg?h=cac311d4&amp;itok=LVmomnaU" width="850" height="525" loading="lazy" class="image-style-story-highlights" />



                                              </div>
                                                          </div>
                  <div class="story-hlight__quote-cta">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__quote">We enter QCC with a goal, a dream, and along the way we acquire skills needed to be successful in the workforce, and in life. We are taught confidence, communication, teamwork, humanity and awareness of our community.</div>
                                                              <div class="story-hlight__cta">
                        <a href="/news/2024/10/04/qcc-foundation-elects-alum-new-president">Jorgo&#039;s Story</a>
                      </div>
                                      </div>
                </div>
              </div>
                          <div class="story-hlight__story story-hlight__item" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="story-hlight__story-inner">
                  <div class="story-hlight__media">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__cover">
                        <img alt="Sandra Laney" title="" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_highlights/public/uploads/images/2025-07/homepage_sandra_story.jpg?h=5a3f1d1f&amp;itok=R2NgoHJf" width="850" height="525" loading="lazy" class="image-style-story-highlights" />



                                              </div>
                                                          </div>
                  <div class="story-hlight__quote-cta">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__quote">I loved my time at QCC. Not having an understanding of what college was, it was a nice entryway. It was game-changing in taking the next steps in my career.</div>
                                                              <div class="story-hlight__cta">
                        <a href="/news/2025/06/06/qcc-around-globe-one-alums-journey-saying-yes">Sandra&#039;s Story</a>
                      </div>
                                      </div>
                </div>
              </div>
                          <div class="story-hlight__story story-hlight__item" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="story-hlight__story-inner">
                  <div class="story-hlight__media">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__cover">
                        <img alt="Donald Collins" title="" src="/sites/default/files/styles/story_highlights/public/uploads/images/2025-07/homeapge_donald_story.jpg?h=fe69096c&amp;itok=08y1ndnE" width="850" height="525" loading="lazy" class="image-style-story-highlights" />



                                              </div>
                                                          </div>
                  <div class="story-hlight__quote-cta">
                                          <div class="story-hlight__quote">I’ve learned so much. I’ve met some of the best professors I’ve ever met in my life. With resilience and hard work nothing is impossible.</div>
                                                              <div class="story-hlight__cta">
                        <a href="/news/2025/01/29/student-month-donald-collins">Donald&#039;s Story</a>
                      </div>
                                      </div>
                </div>
              </div>
